WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.955
Inside the phases, five
workstreams carry the work:

2
00:00:03.955 --> 00:00:07.488
identity, policy, services,
compute and access.

3
00:00:07.488 --> 00:00:09.825
They run together; finishing one before

4
00:00:09.825 --> 00:00:12.587
starting the next roughly
doubles the program.

5
00:00:12.587 --> 00:00:13.900
They still have an order.

6
00:00:13.900 --> 00:00:16.832
Identity comes first, the attribute model,

7
00:00:16.832 --> 00:00:21.606
dynamic membership and the lifecycle
origin, because policy, access,

8
00:00:21.606 --> 00:00:25.962
devices and data all decide on the
basis of who or what is asking.

9
00:00:25.962 --> 00:00:27.674
Policy follows identity.

10
00:00:27.674 --> 00:00:32.525
Services, naming and addressing,
can run in parallel and may bridge.

11
00:00:32.525 --> 00:00:36.175
Compute, the device and server
work, comes mid to late.

12
00:00:36.175 --> 00:00:39.937
Access, token-based and
application-aware, comes later,

13
00:00:39.937 --> 00:00:43.113
because it consumes both
identity and policy.

14
00:00:43.113 --> 00:00:47.286
The master plan organized the same
work as five technology pillars,

15
00:00:47.286 --> 00:00:49.075
and that view leaves two gaps.

16
00:00:49.075 --> 00:00:53.119
Nobody owns the question of which
policy surface owns a setting,

17
00:00:53.119 --> 00:00:55.637
and the access plane has no pillar at all.

18
00:00:55.637 --> 00:00:59.898
Book 01 closes them by giving
policy a security-engineering

19
00:00:59.898 --> 00:01:03.476
lead and access a joint
identity and security lead.

20
00:01:03.476 --> 00:01:07.273
The critical path runs through
the platform, the assessment,

21
00:01:07.273 --> 00:01:12.287
attribute and group design, the pilot,
each rollout wave, and cutover validation.

22
00:01:12.287 --> 00:01:17.175
Every week lost in assessment or
attribute design moves every later gate.

23
00:01:17.175 --> 00:01:21.475
And one dependency never
relaxes: PKI waits for identity.

24
00:01:21.475 --> 00:01:26.621
The decision, made while Phase 0's stakeholders
and decision rights are confirmed:

25
00:01:26.621 --> 00:01:29.930
name the five workstream
leads, including those two.
